# .worktreeinclude
#
# Copy this file to .worktreeinclude to use it. Each task Dove creates gets its
# own git worktree, and git does not copy gitignored files into a new worktree.
# Any path listed here is copied from the project root into each task's
# worktree when it is created, so local secrets and settings are available there.
#
# Format:
#   - One path per line, relative to the project root.
#   - Lines starting with # are comments. Blank lines are ignored.
#   - Only list files that are gitignored. Tracked files are already in the worktree.

# Local environment variables (often contain secrets; never commit them)
.env
.env.local

# Local tool settings
# .npmrc
# config/local.toml
